      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Around $1.2 billion</font></p></td>
